  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening community based forest management to protect the Da Bac&apos; Forests in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to its location in the highlands, the Da Bac District in Viet Nam is vulnerable to the negative impacts of climate change, particularly extreme weather events. This project counteracted these negative impacts by developing and applying a partnership mechanism for effective forest management in Da Bac District. It empowered local communities, especially ethnic minorities, and other stakeholders, to coordinate forest management directly in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
